  - {fileID: -631176807, guid: df113e4a214db7744afe473f1e3dfcc7, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 818073834, guid: df113e4a214db7744afe473f1e3dfcc7, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 51720868064089218, guid: c6673208a91bf9e4da392ce4d2385ccc, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 1254639469, guid: c6673208a91bf9e4da392ce4d2385ccc, type: 3}
  tutorialText:
  - Welcome to Graveyard Thievery!
  - This is a quick tutorial to teach you the game's mechanics.
  - Use WASD or the arrow keys to move around. You can also sprint using SHIFT.
  - You will not start with a flashlight, still press F to try it out.
  - If you walk to your right you will see a bunch of items you can steal. Try some
    thievery!
  - Stealing items fills up your inventory in the top right.
  - When your inventory is full you need to escape through a gate.
  - After escaping you can buy upgrades at your hideout, which is a trashbin...
  - One of these is the taser. Press T to try it out!
  - This is all you need to know, but stay on your guard. There are zombies out to
    get you...
  - Good luck, make sure to save your parents!
  - Press continue to go to the main menu.
  text: {fileID: 424684749}
  button: {fileID: 2013022823}
  canvas: {fileID: 203654854}
  image: {fileID: 1126305124}
  flashlight: {fileID: 1725651853}
  taser: {fileID: 1725651852}
